-- Divisibility over the integers: the basic laws, signs and absolute values,
-- cancellation, the bridge to natural divisibility, the bound |a| ≤ |b| for a
-- divisor of a nonzero integer, the units ±1, evenness as divisibility by
-- two, and further laws of integer congruence
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
